        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Quadr Rb III Atr 1" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="541" ed="#liebermann"/><ptr type="liebermannNote" n="†" target="#Quadr-Rb_III-Atr-1.lnote.la.dagger"/><ptr type="liebermannNote" n="20" target="#Quadr-Rb_III-Atr-1.lnote.la.20"/><ptr type="liebermannNote" n="1" target="#Quadr-Rb_III-Atr-1.lnote.la.1"/>(I. De infractione pacis.</ab>
